    "function": "Broadband quantum-limited amplifier built from a long chain of Josephson junctions that amplifies signals co-propagating with a strong pump over about 3 GHz. It lets one output line serve many resonators across the band, at the cost of higher pump power dissipated at the mixing chamber and a noise temperature somewhat above the JPA's.",
